      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَحْرٌ لُجِّىٌّ</span></b> , (S, K,) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لِجِّىٌّ</span></b> , (K,) and
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لُجَاجٌ</span></b> , (L,) <i>A vast and deep sea.</i> (S, L, K.)
In ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لِجِىٌّ</span></b> , the first vowel is assimilated to the
second to make the word more easy of pronunciation. (TA.)

